        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy Image Upscale- Topaz Wonder 4\n\nUpscale a soft, compressed image with Topaz's Wonder 4 generative model: it rebuilds plausible detail instead of stretching pixels, keeping torn edges, seams and flat color fields intact at 1x to 6x. The workflow takes 1 input image and produces 1 enhanced output next to a side-by-side comparison. Ideal for collage, illustration and graphic work that needs to survive a small or compressed source. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_topaz_image_enhance_wonder4.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
